WEBVTT

00:01.218 --> 00:03.339
Welcome back to the Engine Room Records

00:03.399 --> 00:04.360
Planetarium!

00:09.023 --> 00:13.725
Having crossed the Roche limit, the structural

00:13.765 --> 00:17.908
integrity of our satellite has officially

00:18.048 --> 00:18.528
failed.

00:21.650 --> 00:23.731
We are now experiencing terminal

00:23.871 --> 00:27.893
fragmentation as tidal forces overcome

00:28.014 --> 00:30.155
gravitational self-attraction.

00:32.603 --> 00:34.945
The celestial body shatters into a

00:35.085 --> 00:37.608
high-velocity debris field!

00:43.994 --> 00:48.579
Please remain seated. Embrace.

00:52.883 --> 00:54.645
For immediate impact.

01:39.060 --> 01:41.642
The ground is cracking right beneath my boots.

01:43.984 --> 01:46.406
We're ripping up the foundation, pulling the

01:46.426 --> 01:51.670
roots. The sky is falling in a million jagged

01:51.750 --> 01:56.674
pieces. The pressure building up and it never

01:56.734 --> 01:57.775
releases.

01:59.916 --> 02:04.700
I look up and the moon is ripped in half. Nothing

02:04.820 --> 02:08.143
left to do but watch it burn and laugh.

02:10.723 --> 02:13.325
The gravity is dead, the center cannot hold The

02:13.365 --> 02:15.986
core is spilling out, a story never told It's

02:16.026 --> 02:18.628
raining heavy metal from a shattered sky Kiss

02:18.648 --> 02:21.410
the quiet sanctuary a bitter goodbye

02:21.430 --> 02:26.513
Fragmentation, we're blowing it apart A

02:26.593 --> 02:31.136
million flying pieces of a heavy metal heart

02:31.976 --> 02:37.962
FRAGMENTATION! WELCOME TO THE CRASH! TURNING

02:38.182 --> 02:42.526
ALL THE HISTORY TO CINDERS AND TO ASH! WE'RE

02:42.586 --> 02:45.148
LIVING IN THE MIDDLE OF A DEBRIS FIELD! NO

02:45.188 --> 02:49.232
BLASTERS! NO SHELTER! NO SHIELD!

02:49.792 --> 02:51.113
FRAGMENTATION!

02:55.197 --> 02:57.599
I CAN SEE THE BLACK GUITARS FALLING THROUGH THE

02:57.639 --> 03:05.965
SPACE! A violent collision in the human race The

03:06.005 --> 03:11.947
magma is spilling from the broken crust Turning

03:12.027 --> 03:17.209
all the monuments to powder and dust You wanted a

03:17.269 --> 03:22.111
reaction, you wanted a spark Well now we're

03:22.131 --> 03:24.532
throwing fire right into the dark

03:27.296 --> 03:29.878
The gravity is dead, the center cannot hold The

03:29.919 --> 03:32.541
chorus spilling out, a story never told It's

03:32.581 --> 03:35.204
raining heavy metal from a shattered sky Kiss

03:35.224 --> 03:37.986
the quiet sanctuary a bitter goodbye

03:38.026 --> 03:43.071
Fragmentation, we're blowing it apart A

03:43.151 --> 03:47.675
million flying pieces of a heavy metal heart

03:48.516 --> 03:54.498
FRAGMENTATION! WELCOME TO THE CRASH! TURNING

03:54.678 --> 03:59.120
ALL THE HISTORY TO CINDERS AND TO ASH! WE'RE

03:59.160 --> 04:02.101
LIVING IN THE MIDDLE OF A DEBRIS FIELD! NO BLAST

04:02.141 --> 04:07.623
DOORS! NO SHELTER! NO SHIELD! FRAGMENTATION!

04:18.025 --> 04:18.308
Yay!

04:59.814 --> 05:04.897
Fragmentation! We're blowing it apart! A

05:04.957 --> 05:09.580
million flying pieces of a heavy metal heart!

05:10.381 --> 05:16.384
Fragmentation! Welcome to the crash! Turning

05:16.505 --> 05:20.947
all the history in cinders into ash! We're

05:20.967 --> 05:23.850
living in the middle of a debris field. No blast

05:23.910 --> 05:29.474
doors, no shelter, no shield. Fragmentation.

05:31.155 --> 05:37.260
No shield in the debris field. Watch it shatter.

